+permutation of the residues.  The planted word consists of two copies of the
+cycle (j*d)^3 mod p.  Each required Q has one copy of every residue plus a
+second copy of three consecutive cycle symbols, so Q is literally the
+multiset of a length-(p+3) planted substring.  All requirements are sampled
+from the same three-arc distribution and shuffled.
